{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soulbound Roguelike</i> is a 2D pixel-art action adventure that blends Roguelite build-crafting with divine beasts collection and evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once-glorious \u201cDivine Beast Sect\u201d is now a rat-infested ruin. As the long-suffering\u2014ahem, personally taught\u2014disciple of Master Huang Laoliu, the burden of restoring the sect now rests squarely on your shoulders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated martial-world dungeons, discover and forge contracts with the unique divine beasts hidden within, and craft your own combat style through the dynamic interplay of Martial Skills \u00d7 Blessings \u00d7 Enchantments. Enough of the dull training\u2014dive into fast-paced pixel-art combat and experience the pure Roguelite thrill of crunchy, impactful battles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Thrilling Roguelike Combat \u2013 Your Playstyle, Your Rules!\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Build Playstyle: Choose from a variety of martial skills\u2014blades, firearms, fists, and more. Combine them with 3 skill slots and 9 enchantment slots to easily craft your unique combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/b36bf3f38df00442003193362974c830.poster.avif?t=1766567748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/b36bf3f38df00442003193362974c830.webm?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/b36bf3f38df00442003193362974c830.mp4?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Blessing Combos: Collect Blessings Buffs from different schools (Ice, Fire, Thunder, etc.). Trigger powerful chain reactions to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/a03c78a339c5c8668b613fbbcc58c27c.poster.avif?t=1766567748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/a03c78a339c5c8668b613fbbcc58c27c.webm?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/a03c78a339c5c8668b613fbbcc58c27c.mp4?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Permanent Growth: Cultivate inner techniques to boost stats\u2014HP, Crit Rate, and divine beast attributes, and more. Every adventure out there makes you stronger than before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/43656138a1bea396c0f2cd90c9f3e559.poster.avif?t=1766567748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/43656138a1bea396c0f2cd90c9f3e559.webm?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/43656138a1bea396c0f2cd90c9f3e559.mp4?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Ride, Fight, and Meme\u2014With Divine Beasts in Hand, the World is Yours!\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Divine Beast Collection: What hatches from the eggs in hidden dungeons? Besides the mighty Azure Dragon and the chill Capybara, there\u2019s even \u201cChicken Bro\u201d, trained for two and a half years\u2026 Collectors, this is your paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/64ad589afe75f704353fe90ed19c69cb.poster.avif?t=1766567748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/64ad589afe75f704353fe90ed19c69cb.webm?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/64ad589afe75f704353fe90ed19c69cb.mp4?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Battle Companions: Ride your Divine Beasts through sky and earth, fight side by side, and even beginners can pick it up in 3 seconds\u2014clear dungeons with pure joy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/46d58c75c4081c3d1c31c7d996d38c44.poster.avif?t=1766567748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/46d58c75c4081c3d1c31c7d996d38c44.webm?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/46d58c75c4081c3d1c31c7d996d38c44.mp4?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Divine Beast Fusion: Combine your Divine Beasts to create new species\u2014will they be cooler or crazier? Come open your blind boxes and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/b3553b63b4e020f5a556ccf76d066b20.poster.avif?t=1766567748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/b3553b63b4e020f5a556ccf76d066b20.webm?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/b3553b63b4e020f5a556ccf76d066b20.mp4?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Manage Your Sect and Climb to the Top of the Global Rankings!\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Ascend the Ranking Ladder: The World is vast and full of masters. Compete in global, real-time sect rankings and challenge player factions from all corners of the world in battles that transcend mountains and seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/4ef6ebc1c1e8e1e30f6f546e07188689.poster.avif?t=1766567748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/4ef6ebc1c1e8e1e30f6f546e07188689.webm?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/4ef6ebc1c1e8e1e30f6f546e07188689.mp4?t=1766567748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 Idle Management: A sect can\u2019t run without silver! Assign your Divine Beasts to the \u201cSoulbeast Gallery\u201d and watch silver roll in while you\u2019re asleep. Disciple slack-off level: 9999+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/c84463f4722f0abca1124833e8a9885d.poster.avif?t=1766567748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432110/extras/c84463f4722f0abca1124833e